                "We landed, collected our bags and left."
              ],
              [
                "Past Continuous",
                "фон, действие в процессе",
                "It was raining and people were rushing."
              ],
              [
                "Past Perfect",
                "событие раньше основного",
                "We'd missed the connecting flight."
              ],
              [
                "Past Perfect Continuous",
                "длительный процесс до момента в прошлом",
                "We'd been waiting for six hours when they cancelled it."
              ]
            ]
          },
          "tip": "Past Perfect Continuous (had been + -ing) объясняет состояние: She was exhausted because she'd been travelling all night."
